===Noun===
{{la-noun|quadrīgae<1>|g=f}}

# A [[four]] [[horse]] [[team]], especially used for [[chariot]] [[racing]].
# {{lb|la|poetic}} The four-horse team drawing the chariot of the [[sun]].
# {{lb|la|figuratively}} [[free rein|Free rein]], free course.

